  "ID": "48638",
  "post_title": "Espectacular concert de la banda i el cor de la Unió Musical de Suera, per a cloure la XXX Setmana Cultural",
  "post_date": "2014-08-08 09:23:43",
  "post_name": "espectacular-concert-de-la-banda-i-el-cor-de-la-unio-musical-de-suera-per-a-cloure-la-xxx-setmana-cultural",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>La banda i el cor de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera han oferit la nit d&#39;aquest dijous a la pla&ccedil;a un concert espectacular, amb el t&iacute;tol Toquem de cor i a la mem&ograve;ria de Joan Palanques, destacat integrant del Centre Cultural, mort ara fa dos anys.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_4988.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Amb la pla&ccedil;a plena de gom a gom, en el concert de cloenda dela XXX Setmana Cultural, organitzada pel Centre Cultural Suera, s&#39;han oferit versions del Cor d&#39;esclaus hebreus, del Nabuco de Verdi, El reloj, de Roberto Cantoral, Amor de hombre, de Mocedades, La morena de mi copla, de Carlos Castellano, Frenes&iacute;, d&#39;Alberto Dom&iacute;nguez, Un beso y una flor, de Nino Bravo, Viva el pasodoble, de Roc&iacute;o Jurado, I just called to say&nbsp;I love you, d&#39;Stevie Wonder, YMCA, de Village People, Mamma Mia, d&#39;Abba, i Summer nights, de la pel&middot;l&iacute;cula Grease. La direcci&oacute; i arranjaments de la coral han estat a c&agrave;rrec d&#39;Alberto Mart&iacute; Navarro i els arranjaments de banda han sigut obra del seu director, Jos&eacute; Dami&aacute;n Navarro.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_4991.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Despr&eacute;s de la salutaci&oacute; d&#39;aquest &uacute;ltim i el president de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera, Eduard Sorita Calatayud, s&#39;ha oferit un bis.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4972.jpg\" alt=\"img_4972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4974.jpg\" alt=\"img_4974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4977.jpg\" alt=\"img_4977\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4978.jpg\" alt=\"img_4978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4979.jpg\" alt=\"img_4979\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4980.jpg\" alt=\"img_4980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4981.jpg\" alt=\"img_4981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4982.jpg\" alt=\"img_4982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4983.jpg\" alt=\"img_4983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4987.jpg\" alt=\"img_4987\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4988.jpg\" alt=\"img_4988\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertbandacoruniomusicalsueracloendaxxxsetmanacultural/img_4989.jpg\" alt=\"img_4989\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" 